stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: createElection()

    Pending --> Active: startElection()
    note right of Pending
        Allowed actions:
        - Add candidates
        - Authorize voters
        - Revoke voters
        - Configure election
    end note

    Active --> Ended: endElection()
    note right of Active
        Allowed actions:
        - Cast ballot
        - Modify ballot
        - Authorize voters
        Blocked:
        - Add candidates
        - Revoke voters
    end note

    Ended --> Finalized: finalizeElection()
    note right of Ended
        Allowed actions:
        - View results (preliminary)
        Blocked:
        - All voting
        - All modification
        - Candidate changes
    end note

    Finalized --> [*]
    note right of Finalized
        Terminal state:
        - Results locked
        - Winner determined
        - No further changes
    end note
